%e A400953   12: 650, 325, 217, 164, 144, 144, 144, 144, 144, 144, 144, 144
%e A400953   ...
%e A400953 T(4,2) = 16, because, of the seven 2-way subset partitions of [1,4,9,16], 16 is the smallest maximum subset sum, which only happens in one way, (16),(1,4,9).
%e A400953 .
%e A400953 T(4,3) = 16, because, of the six 3-way subset partitions of [1,4,9,16], 16 is the smallest maximum subset sum, which happens in three different ways, (16),(1),(4,9), (16),(1,4),(9), and (16),(1,9),(4).
